<title>HUNGARY: CESI share index falls to close at 1,526.60 pts.</title>
<headline>CESI share index falls to close at 1,526.60 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index fell on Thursday to end at 1,526.60 points, down 20.46 points or 1.32 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
